# Build And Test Rules

- Use Xcode build/test commands when possible.
- Run one focused iPhone simulator only.
- Do not test many devices unless approved.
- If a build fails, report the exact error and the likely file.
- Do not hide build failures.
- Do not make unrelated fixes during test cleanup.

